1
00:00:00,142 --> 00:00:06,646
Part 11 mein credit control: chemist ki credit limit, utilisation, overdue bills,

2
00:00:06,646 --> 00:00:14,274
hold aur block, ageing, aur ek practical example ki limit cross hone par order ka kya hota hai.

3
00:00:15,231 --> 00:00:19,094
Finance mein Credit control kholiye.

4
00:00:19,094 --> 00:00:27,893
Upar market ka kul outstanding, overdue, aur ageing ke buckets hain: 31 se 60 din,

5
00:00:27,893 --> 00:00:32,507
61 se 90, 91 se 120, aur 120 din se purana.

6
00:00:33,168 --> 00:00:40,706
Table mein har chemist: credit limit, balance, limit ka kitna percent use hua, overdue,

7
00:00:40,706 --> 00:00:44,346
sabse purana bill, status, aur risk score.

8
00:00:44,346 --> 00:00:51,884
Why column saaf batata hai ki risk kyon high hai, jaise limit se upar, ya dues overdue.

9
00:00:52,547 --> 00:00:57,202
Salesman, territory aur risk se filter kar sakte hain.

10
00:00:57,202 --> 00:01:01,426
Jaise Ravi Kumar ke chemists, aur sirf high risk.

11
00:01:01,426 --> 00:01:06,943
Isse har salesman ko pata chalta hai ki kisse vasooli karni hai.

12
00:01:07,598 --> 00:01:09,485
Ab practical example.

13
00:01:09,485 --> 00:01:18,022
Shree Ram Medical Hall ki credit limit 50,000 rupaye hai aur 45,000 rupaye pehle se baaki hain.

14
00:01:18,022 --> 00:01:23,683
Yeh chemist ab lagbhag 15,000 rupaye ka naya order de raha hai.

15
00:01:23,683 --> 00:01:25,930
Dekhte hain kya hota hai.

16
00:01:26,592 --> 00:01:31,992
Book order kholte hain, Shree Ram Medical Hall chunte hain.

17
00:01:31,992 --> 00:01:36,110
Upar credit limit aur balance dikh rahe hain.

18
00:01:36,110 --> 00:01:43,340
Telmiva 40 ke 120 packs jodte hain, jo GST ke saath lagbhag 15,000 rupaye hain.

19
00:01:43,993 --> 00:01:46,005
Place order dabaiye.

20
00:01:46,005 --> 00:01:51,134
Order ban toh gaya, par credit hold par chala gaya.

21
00:01:51,134 --> 00:01:57,571
45,000 plus 15,000 yaani 60,000, jo 50,000 ki limit se upar hai.

22
00:01:57,571 --> 00:02:01,293
Yeh order apne-aap approve nahi hoga.

23
00:02:01,948 --> 00:02:03,058
Order kholiye.

24
00:02:03,058 --> 00:02:08,452
Value and credit card par saaf likha hai ki limit cross ho rahi hai.

25
00:02:08,452 --> 00:02:12,338
Approve ki jagah Override and approve button hai,

26
00:02:12,338 --> 00:02:18,128
jo sirf owner ya manager ke paas hota hai, aur reason likhna zaroori hai.

27
00:02:18,128 --> 00:02:22,728
Har override audit trail mein naam ke saath darj hota hai.

28
00:02:23,381 --> 00:02:26,263
Hum yahan override nahi karenge.

29
00:02:26,263 --> 00:02:29,955
Sahi tareeka hai pehle purana paisa lena.

30
00:02:29,955 --> 00:02:33,737
Chemist ne 10,000 rupaye UPI se bhej diye.

31
00:02:33,737 --> 00:02:37,969
Collections mein yeh payment record karte hain.

32
00:02:38,616 --> 00:02:40,769
Ab balance 35,000 hai.

33
00:02:40,769 --> 00:02:45,760
35,000 plus naya order lagbhag 50,000 ke andar hai.

34
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:50,065
Order par wapas jaakar Approve dabaate hain.

35
00:02:50,065 --> 00:02:53,588
Ab bina override ke approve ho gaya.

36
00:02:54,247 --> 00:02:56,355
Hold aur block alag hain.

37
00:02:56,355 --> 00:03:01,415
Chemist ki profile mein Put on hold ya Block kar sakte hain.

38
00:03:01,415 --> 00:03:06,896
Tupudana Rural Medicos par hold hai, kyunki do cheque bounce hue.

39
00:03:06,896 --> 00:03:11,871
Hold wale chemist ke naye bill bina override ke nahi bante.

40
00:03:11,871 --> 00:03:14,907
Block matlab koi naya order hi nahi.

41
00:03:15,558 --> 00:03:18,914
Licence bhi credit control ka hissa hai.

42
00:03:18,914 --> 00:03:25,795
Jis chemist ka drug licence expire ho gaya, uska order Medoro refuse kar deta hai.

43
00:03:25,795 --> 00:03:30,578
Isliye har chemist ki licence validity date sahi rakhiye.

44
00:03:31,230 --> 00:03:38,864
Credit control ka matlab bikri rokna nahi, balki sahi chemist ko sahi had tak udhaar dena hai.

45
00:03:38,864 --> 00:03:43,250
Isse bad debt kam hota hai aur cash flow sudharta hai.
